        "emotionalTone": "Reassuring, health-conscious, accommodating, and compliant.",
        "formalityLevel": "neutral",
        "spatialContext": "Commercial catering prep kitchens (segregated allergen-free prep zones, dedicated fryers, separate cutting boards and toasters), buffet labeling stands, conference registration dietary intake forms, and flight galley special-meal carts.",
