          "whenNotToUse": "Do not confuse 'kosher' with 'halal' or 'vegan'—although they share certain dietary exclusions, each follows distinct theological and procedural guidelines. Avoid using the informal colloquial sense ('is this deal kosher?') in formal legal documentation or contractual drafting.",
