        "whenNotToUse": "Do not use for casual or fast-food restaurant staff (do not refer to a cashier, cafeteria counter worker, or casual diner host as a 'maitre-d'). Do not use for the head chef or culinary staff in the kitchen (who manage back-of-house operations). Avoid using for a regular busser or food runner.",
