        "whenNotToUse": "Do not use 'sandwich' for hot meals served in bowls or plated entrees requiring a knife and fork (such as casseroles, pasta, or stews). Avoid calling a hamburger just a 'sandwich' in casual speech (natives almost always say 'burger' or 'cheeseburger'). Do not use 'sandwich' for sweet confectioneries unless qualified (such as 'ice cream sandwich').",
