        "spatialContext": "Commercial restaurant cook lines, banquet saut\u00e9 stations, catering prep galleys, open-kitchen display counters at executive receptions, and hotel culinary suites.",
        "temporalContext": "Prepared strictly \u00e0 la minute (cooked immediately upon order) within 3 to 6 minutes; plated and served instantly while piping hot to prevent steam condensation from making the vegetables limp or tender meats tough."
